{"source": "mrds", "article_key": "193963", "url": "https://www.mrds66.com/archives/193963/", "title": "糖心Vlog极品御姐 半碗奶盖 化身酒店服务员 用白虎蜜穴补偿顾客避免客诉", "published_at": "2026-09-19", "html": "<div class=\"post-content\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\n<p>半碗奶盖穿着白衬衫蓝短裙和点点丝袜，戴着口罩化身酒店服务员，为了补偿顾客避免客诉，解开领带露出深沟巨乳，随后跪在地上给客人深喉口交，在用自己的巨乳疯狂夹击着客人的肉棒，接着用丝袜美足夹住肉棒足交，再被压在床上后入狂操，双腿大开接受撞击，最后客人把浓精全部射在玉足和脚心上。</p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片1\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-a5c9cde42ff6.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片2\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-3571044480a3.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片3\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-7580315bd5f1.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片4\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-2e417348026c.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片5\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-96d6e81ce390.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片6\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-72be2ec88fa9.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片7\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-4cc69c0e3a43.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片8\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-06c456862c00.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"糖心Vlog极品御姐相关图片9\" src=\"mrds/193963/img-cf988855f5d3.jpg\"/></p><div class=\"dplayer dplayer-no-danmaku\" data-config='{\"live\":false,\"autoplay\":false,\"theme\":\"#FADFA3\",\"loop\":false,\"screenshot\":false,\"hotkey\":true,\"preload\":\"metadata\",\"lang\":\"zh-cn\",\"logo\":null,\"volume\":0.69999999999999996,\"ads_skip\":0,\"ads_duration\":5,\"video_player_ads\":[{\"src\":\"https:\\/\\/pic.ndhixj.cn\\/hc237\\/uploads\\/default\\/other\\/2026-09-23\\/e9d8f0bcc4ab58534d7ce3845e77d824.gif\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/ltke116.top:3371\",\"data-page_key\":\"video_player_ads\",\"data-page_name\":\"\\u89c6\\u9891\\u64ad\\u653e\\u5668\\u5e7f\\u544a\",\"data-ad_slot_key\":\"video_player_ads\",\"data-ad_slot_name\":\"\\u6625\\u836f\\u9ad8\\u6f6e\",\"data-ad_id\":\"2064347979348500480\",\"data-creative_id\":\"\"},{\"src\":\"https:\\/\\/pic.ndhixj.cn\\/hc237\\/uploads\\/default\\/other\\/2026-09-01\\/efff9ef032154750492211a05356d91f.gif\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/stjo009.vip: